= Locarno Treaty 

Britain unites with fellow european nations such as France, Belgium, Germany and Poland to guarantee the post war borders borders between Germany and France and Germany and Belgium as defined in the Treaty of Versailles. 

Other topics agreed upon was the maintenance of the demilitarized zone Rhineland. Germany agreed to the peaceful settlement of disputes.

